<newsitem itemid="180975" id="root" date="1996-11-11" xml:lang="en">
<title>UK: Capital Radio year pretax profit up 21 pct.</title>
<headline>Capital Radio year pretax profit up 21 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to September 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		29.4		   vs 24.0</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 12.5		   vs up 22 pct</p>
<p> Pretax		     32.1		   vs 26.53</p>
<p> Turnover		   77.8		   vs 67.4</p>
<p> Final dividend (pence)  8.5		   vs  7.0</p>
<p> Operating profit	 27.9		   vs 23.3</p>
<p> Exceptional		nil		    vs gain 13.39</p>
<p> Tax			  10.5		   vs 13.5</p>
<p> Pay date		   Jan 31, 1997</p>
<p>Div registration date  Nov 26  Ex-div date		Nov 18</p>
<p>NOTE - Capital Radio Plc also announced it was making a recommended bid for theme restaurant operator My Kinda Town Plc, valuing MKT's shares and warrants at 51 million stg.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
